  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9408.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9408.01 Scope. This part allows an individual, whose vehicle has been removed from its location and stored at another by an authorized official, to request a hearing to contest the removal.\n\nSource. #13653, eff 5-26-23 (formerly Saf-C 216.01)",
